    <li data-icon="star"><span class="title">Scholarships at HIT Shenzhen</span><span class="where">Outstanding Student Scholarship, first prize 2020 and 2021, second prize 2019; Xidian Scholarship special prize 2020; Gongjin Scholarship 2020; first-year project excellence award 2021</span></li>
    <li data-icon="doc"><span class="title">Patents</span><span class="where">Invention patent CN112097213B (with its utility-model twin) and application CN121763247A. <a href="/research/#patents">Details</a></span></li>
