  <h2 data-under>Outside the lab</h2>
  <p>Badminton (the most-booked court of my booking bot), tennis, the gym, cycling and skiing. Piano lessons since May 2026. Photography with a Sony A7R II, mostly long telephoto: mountains, night cities, animals, campus, plus a roll or two of film. Drawing practice. Flying FPV. Board games, Hive above all. Video games, especially the ones where you build a factory (Factorio, Dyson Sphere Program) and the ones where you run the server for friends (Don't Starve Together, Terraria).</p>
  <p>I also like retro industrial design (Braun, tiny CRTs), watches, transit-card art, pixel art and the demoscene, which explains most of the <a href="/projects/#agents">small-screen projects</a>.</p>

  <h2 data-under>Timeline</h2>
